  "instructions": "Taiwan stock backtesting harness. You write strategies; the engine runs them.\n\nA strategy is a Python file (usually strategies/<name>.py) defining\n    PARAMS = {...}\n    def on_bar(hist, pos, p) -> float\nhist is a DataFrame of bars up to and including today (open, high, low, close, volume,\ndividend); pos is the current position as a fraction of equity; p is PARAMS merged with\noverrides. Return the target position, 0.0 to 1.0. It fills at the next day's open and only\nchanges when the returned target changes. Indicators: `from trader import ta`\n(sma, ema, rsi, macd, bbands, atr; they compose).\n\nEvery backtest has two explicit periods, each compared with buy-and-hold:\n策略開發期間 (development: design and tune the strategy here) and 策略執行期間 (execution:\na simulated live run that starts flat with the initial cash; indicators may use earlier\nbars). Tune on the development period only. A study is one symbol, one strategy file and\nboth periods; finalize it with finalize_study. Quote numbers exactly as the tools return\nthem.",
  "tools": [
    {
      "description": "Find Taiwan stocks and ETFs by code or Chinese name, e.g. \"台積電\" or \"2330\".",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "title": "Query",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "query"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "title": "search_stockArguments"
      },
      "name": "search_stock",
      "outputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "title": "Result",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "result"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "title": "search_stockOutput"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Daily bars (YYYY-MM-DD dates, inclusive). Shows the last `limit` rows.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "symbol": {
            "title": "Symbol",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "start": {
            "title": "Start",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "end": {
            "title": "End",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "limit": {
            "default": 60,
            "title": "Limit",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "symbol",
          "start",
          "end"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "title": "get_ohlcvArguments"
      },
      "name": "get_ohlcv",
      "outputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "title": "Result",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "result"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "title": "get_ohlcvOutput"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Backtest a strategy file on one symbol over a development and an execution period.\n\n    Dates are YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive, with dev_start <= dev_end < exec_start <= exec_end.\n    hypothesis (required): one sentence stating what this run tests, in formal written\n    language. params overrides keys in the strategy's PARAMS. fee overrides the default\n    fee schedule (commission_rate, min_commission, sell_tax_rate, floor_to_unit).\n    ",
      "inputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "strategy": {
            "title": "Strategy",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "symbol": {
            "title": "Symbol",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "dev_start": {
            "title": "Dev Start",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "dev_end": {
            "title": "Dev End",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "exec_start": {
            "title": "Exec Start",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "exec_end": {
            "title": "Exec End",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "hypothesis": {
            "title": "Hypothesis",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "params": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "title": "Params"
          },
          "cash": {
            "default": 1000000,
            "title": "Cash",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "fee": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "type": "object"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "title": "Fee"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "strategy",
          "symbol",
          "dev_start",
          "dev_end",
          "exec_start",
          "exec_end",
          "hypothesis"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "title": "run_backtestArguments"
      },
      "name": "run_backtest",
      "outputSchema": {
        "properties": {
          "result": {
            "title": "Result",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "result"
        ],
        "type": "object",
        "title": "run_backtestOutput"
      }
    },
    {
